		padding: 16px;
		border: 1px solid #e8eaef;
		border-radius: 10px;
		background: #fafbfc;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.score-label {
		font-size: 11px;
		color: #626a76;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		margin-bottom: 6px;
	}
	.score-num {
